3. The mock data includes all required fields from the OrganizationBranding type including id, name, slug, logoUrl, fullDomain, domainSuffix, role, and theme-related properties

This should resolve the error because now we're providing the OrgBrandingProvider with the correct data structure that the useOrgBranding hook expects.

